showdown.moves.spicyextract.name=Острый экстракт
showdown.moves.spicyextract.desc=Повышает Атаку цели на 2 ступени и понижает ее Защиту на 2 ступени.
showdown.moves.spicyextract.shortDesc=Повышает атаку цели на 2 и снижает ее защиту на 2.
showdown.moves.spiderweb.name=Паутина
showdown.moves.spiderweb.desc=Prevents the target from switching out. The target can still switch out if it is holding Shed Shell or uses Baton Pass, Flip Turn, Parting Shot, Teleport, U-turn, or Volt Switch. If the target leaves the field using Baton Pass, the replacement will remain trapped. The effect ends if the user leaves the field.
showdown.moves.spiderweb.shortDesc=Предотвращает выключение цели.
showdown.moves.spikecannon.name=Шипастая пушка
showdown.moves.spikecannon.desc=Ударит от двух до пяти раз. Имеет 35% шанс попасть два или три раза и 15% шанс попасть четыре или пять раз. Если одно из попаданий пробьет substitute цели, она получит урон за оставшиеся попадания. Если у пользователя есть способность Skill Link, этот прием всегда будет выполняться пять раз.
showdown.moves.spikecannon.shortDesc=Ударяет 2-5 раз за ход.
showdown.moves.spikes.name=Шипы
showdown.moves.spikes.desc=Sets up a hazard on the opposing side of the field, damaging each opposing Pokémon that switches in, unless it is a Flying-type Pokémon or has the Levitate Ability. Can be used up to three times before failing. Opponents lose 1/8 of their maximum HP with one layer, 1/6 of their maximum HP with two layers, and 1/4 of their maximum HP with three layers, all rounded down. Can be removed from the opposing side if any opposing Pokémon uses Mortal Spin, Rapid Spin, or Defog successfully, or is hit by Defog.
showdown.moves.spikes.shortDesc=Наносит урон противникам, подвергшимся воздействию ground, при включении. Максимум 3 слоя.
showdown.moves.spikes.start=Spikes были разбросаны по ground, все around %s!
showdown.moves.spikes.end=шипы исчезли с земли around %s!
showdown.moves.spikes.damage=%s был ранен by the spikes!
showdown.moves.spikyshield.name=Колючий щит
showdown.moves.spikyshield.desc=The user is protected from most attacks made by other Pokémon during this turn, and Pokémon making contact with the user lose 1/8 of their maximum HP, rounded down. This move has a 1/X chance of being successful, where X starts at 1 and triples each time this move is successfully used. X resets to 1 if this move fails, if the user's last move used is not Baneful Bunker, Burning Bulwark, Detect, Endure, King's Shield, Max Guard, Obstruct, Protect, Quick Guard, Silk Trap, Spiky Shield, or Wide Guard, or if it was one of those moves and the user's protection was broken. Fails if the user moves last this turn.
