showdown.moves.springtidestorm.name=Весенний шторм
showdown.moves.springtidestorm.desc=Имеет 30% шанс снизить Атаку цели на 1 ступень.
showdown.moves.springtidestorm.shortDesc=30% шанс снизить атаку врага(ов) на 1.
showdown.moves.stealthrock.name=Потайной камень
showdown.moves.stealthrock.desc=Sets up a hazard on the opposing side of the field, damaging each opposing Pokémon that switches in. Fails if the effect is already active on the opposing side. Foes lose 1/32, 1/16, 1/8, 1/4, or 1/2 of their maximum HP, rounded down, based on their weakness to the Rock type; 0.25x, 0.5x, neutral, 2x, or 4x, respectively. Can be removed from the opposing side if any opposing Pokémon uses Mortal Spin, Rapid Spin, or Defog successfully, or is hit by Defog.
